        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Mom Hid My Game! 2 is the sequel to the 2016 mobile puzzle game Mom Hid My Game!. Similar to the original title, players solve 30 point-and-click puzzles to find a boy's Nintendo DS that his mom has hidden, using solutions that are often surreal and comedic, such as playing Tetris and catching a UFO.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mom Hid My Game! 2 es la secuela del juego de puzles para móviles Mom Hid My Game!, lanzado en 2016. Al igual que el título original, los jugadores resuelven 30 puzles de tipo point-and-click para encontrar la Nintendo DS de un niño que su madre ha escondido, mediante soluciones a menudo surrealistas y cómicas, como jugar al Tetris o atrapar un OVNI.",
          "source": "claude",
